		<dc:creator><![CDATA[mpatel]]></dc:creator>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Every study says the same thing: teenagers&#8217; bodies are not built for a 7:30 bell.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2>What the data shows</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>First-period absences run <strong>almost double</strong> second period.<br>That is the number that should move the board.</p>
